        "TileImage": "$($repository f802f821-4b53-40d2-84cb-11a7b1605326).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Hokkaido, 47.\r\rA newly hired GAMA pathologist has identified an ICA asset admitted under a false identity. After finding the autopsy report of his deceased lookalike, officially dead for months, our target began investigating.\r\rHis employment records reveal a history of illicit drug use. His death must look accidental: one hallucinogenic trip too many.\r\rEliminate the target. No witnesses, no body, no evidence.\r\rI’ll leave you to prepare.",
